OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMI5 chief warns of threats to UK from
OL,4,ARussia, Iran and AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt an annual speech in London, MI5's
OL,7,Fchief said Russia was waging hybrid
OL,8,Fwarfare at a time when AI was
OL,9,F"supercharging the cyber-security
OL,10,Fcontest between attackers and
OL,11,Fdefenders".
OL,13,FHe also warned of rising threats from
OL,14,F"extreme right-wing terrorism" and said
OL,15,FMI5 had "caught terrorists seeking to
OL,16,Fexploit AI," including by integrating
OL,17,Fthe technology with drones.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
