OL,5,
OL,6,FKyiv has reported multiple Russian
OL,7,Fstrikes since US President Donald Trump
OL,8,Fsaid an energy ceasefire had been
OL,9,Fagreed by Russia and Ukraine two days
OL,10,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
