OL,3,ASaudi man charged with planting
OL,4,A'sophisticated' recording device in
OL,5,AOpenAI office
OL,6,
OL,7,FOpenAI said it had discovered a
OL,8,F"sophisticated recording device" hidden
OL,9,Fin their San Francisco office and
OL,10,Falerted the FBI. The company said it
OL,11,Fused its AI models to track that it had
OL,12,Fbeen planted by an employee.
OL,14,FProsecutors say the device, wrapped in
OL,15,Ftoilet paper, was found inserted in a
OL,16,FUSB port on the back of a TV in an
OL,17,Fexecutive conference room.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
